WEBVTT

00:00:30.969 --> 00:00:34.176
And I think that was really,
really intense for people to process.

00:00:35.482 --> 00:00:40.191
That so much of their identity
and who they were

00:00:40.215 --> 00:00:43.593
was somewhat scaffolded by the identity

00:00:43.617 --> 00:00:45.054
of the place that they worked,

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:48.467
that now it became
like an existential discussion.

00:00:51.457 --> 00:00:54.990
And then you've got your grandparents
who didn't even know where you worked

00:00:55.014 --> 00:00:58.134
are calling you now being, like,
"Hey, that's the place you work?"

00:00:58.158 --> 00:01:02.221
And you almost go
to, like, a place of shame.